cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite this software using the metadata below and the exact release URL
  or commit. This is an early research release under active revision.
type: software
title: "SequentialLearning: Lean formalisation of sequential estimands"
authors:
  - family-names: Pascall
    given-names: "David J."
    affiliation: "MRC Biostatistics Unit, University of Cambridge"
version: "0.1.0-alpha.1"
date-released: "2026-09-10"
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 developments for sequential estimands and learning, including a
  geometric taxonomy, Frechet risk and variance, information and movement
  identities, Hilbert decompositions, Wasserstein displacement bounds,
  absorption-oracle results, and finite counterexamples. This early snapshot
  accompanies a working manuscript; correspondence revisions are documented
  in docs/STATUS.md.
keywords:
  - sequential estimands
  - formal verification
  - Lean 4
  - mathematical statistics
  - conditional expectation
  - Wasserstein distance
